# 🔥 Smart Fire & Gas Detection System

A real-time IoT monitoring system that detects dangerous gas levels, activates a local alarm, sends Telegram notifications, streams a live camera feed, and visualizes sensor data using Grafana.

---

 Project Overview

This project uses two ESP32 boards:

- **ESP32 Sensor Node**
  - Reads the MQ-5 Gas Sensor.
  - Reads the BMP280 (Temperature, Pressure, Altitude).
  - Calculates a moving average for gas readings.
  - Classifies gas levels into SAFE, WARNING, or DANGER.
  - Activates a buzzer during dangerous gas levels.
  - Sends data to Node-RED via HTTP.
  - Sends Telegram alerts when gas reaches the DANGER level.

- **ESP32-CAM**
  - Runs independently as a live web server.
  - Provides real-time video streaming.
  - Camera link is included in Telegram notifications.
  - Live stream is embedded into the Grafana dashboard.

