# 📊 Sensor Information

## MQ-5 Gas Sensor

Detects combustible gases.

The ESP32 calculates the moving average of the last five readings before classification.

### Risk Levels

| Gas Average | Status |
|-------------|--------|
| < 2100 | SAFE |
| 2100 - 2599 | WARNING |
| ≥ 2600 | DANGER |

---

## BMP280

Measures:

- Temperature (°C)
- Pressure (hPa)
- Altitude (m)

---

# 🔄 System Workflow

1. Read MQ-5 gas sensor.
2. Read BMP280.
3. Calculate moving average.
4. Classify gas level.
5. Activate buzzer if DANGER.
6. Send Telegram notification.
7. Send data to Node-RED.
8. Store data in InfluxDB.
9. Grafana updates automatically.
10. ESP32-CAM continuously streams live video.

---

# 📱 Telegram Notification

When the gas reaches the DANGER threshold, Telegram sends a notification containing:

- Gas Average
- Risk Level
- Temperature
- Pressure
- Altitude
- Live Camera Link
- Grafana Dashboard Link

Example:

```
🚨 GAS DANGER DETECTED

Gas Average: 2755

Status: DANGER

Temperature: 25.4°C

Pressure: 1005.3 hPa

Altitude: 32.5 m

Live Camera:
http://ESP32-CAM-IP

Grafana Dashboard:
http://Grafana-IP:3000
```

---

